{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-practical-roleplay-new-york-city-airport-to-hotel-by-airtrain-subway-and-bus-write-like/audio/main-eafd41a0af9e.mp3","durationSec":119.136,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.98,"text":"At JFK, AirTrain is the first part of this journey into the city."},{"start":4.74,"end":8.32,"text":"It connects the airport terminals with Jamaica Station and Howard Beach."},{"start":9.54,"end":11.52,"text":"Travel between airport terminals is free."},{"start":11.52,"end":15.46,"text":"Travel to Jamaica or Howard Beach has a separate fare."},{"start":16.46,"end":22.16,"text":"For a journey towards Midtown Manhattan, Jamaica Station and the E train are a clear choice."},{"start":23.3,"end":26.38,"text":"Another option is Howard Beach and the A train."},{"start":26.38,"end":30,"text":"These are different connections, so name the station when you ask for help."},{"start":30,"end":35.18,"text":"You can ask about Jamaica Station first, then ask which subway to take."},{"start":35.92,"end":38.6,"text":"This makes your question clear without a long explanation."},{"start":39.84,"end":44.06,"text":"AirTrain and the subway are separate parts of your journey, with separate fares."},{"start":45.16,"end":50.12,"text":"The AirTrain fare to Jamaica Station or Howard Beach is $8.75."},{"start":51,"end":52.98,"text":"You pay that fare at those stations."},{"start":53.78,"end":57.82,"text":"You can use a contactless payment method or OMNY."},{"start":58.38,"end":61.6,"text":"The subway fare is $3, and you tap at the turnstile."},{"start":62.2,"end":67.94,"text":"Together, these two fares are $11.75 for this airport and subway journey."},{"start":68.64,"end":70.8,"text":"Keep the two payments clear when you ask for help."},{"start":71.58,"end":75.72,"text":"A useful question is whether a payment is for AirTrain or for the subway."},{"start":76.42,"end":80,"text":"You do not need a long speech to understand what you are paying for."},{"start":82.2,"end":86.44,"text":"A local bus can be another part of a city journey after the subway."},{"start":87.32,"end":89.94,"text":"The subway and local bus fare is $3."},{"start":90.54,"end":96.1,"text":"A free transfer is available within two hours when you use the same card or device."},{"start":97.02,"end":99.18,"text":"On the subway, you tap at the turnstile."},{"start":99.78,"end":101.92,"text":"On a bus, you tap at the reader."},{"start":102.68,"end":106.7,"text":"If you paid with your phone on the subway, use that same device for the transfer."},{"start":107.36,"end":110.58,"text":"Changing to a different card does not follow the same-card rule."},{"start":111.3,"end":114.86,"text":"Before choosing a bus, explain where you want to go."},{"start":115.2,"end":118.64,"text":"This example does not give a bus route to a particular hotel."}],"words":[{"text":"At","start":0,"end":0.22},{"text":"JFK","start":0.22,"end":0.72},{"text":"AirTrain","start":1.32,"end":1.64},{"text":"is","start":1.64,"end":1.9},{"text":"the","start":1.9,"end":2.06},{"text":"first","start":2.06,"end":2.34},{"text":"part","start":2.34,"end":2.62},{"text":"of","start":2.62,"end":2.76},{"text":"this","start":2.76,"end":2.94},{"text":"journey","start":2.94,"end":3.2},{"text":"into","start":3.2,"end":3.54},{"text":"the","start":3.54,"end":3.72},{"text":"city","start":3.72,"end":3.98},{"text":"It","start":4.74,"end":4.9},{"text":"connects","start":4.9,"end":5.22},{"text":"the","start":5.22,"end":5.42},{"text":"airport","start":5.42,"end":5.72},{"text":"terminals","start":5.72,"end":6.16},{"text":"with","start":6.16,"end":6.44},{"text":"Jamaica","start":6.44,"end":6.8},{"text":"Station","start":6.8,"end":7.22},{"text":"and","start":7.22,"end":7.7},{"text":"Howard","start":7.7,"end":8.04},{"text":"Beach","start":8.04,"end":8.32},{"text":"Travel","start":9.54,"end":9.66},{"text":"between","start":9.66,"end":10.14},{"text":"airport","start":10.14,"end":10.5},{"text":"terminals","start":1